title: "helios-provenance-spec"
abstract: "JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) describing feature-level provenance for fused space-weather model outputs, plus a pydantic v2 reference implementation. Composes SPASE 2.7.1, W3C PROV-JSON, and RO-Crate 1.2 JSON-LD with a novel feature-level transformation chain. Issued as an open RFC for community comment."
